{"audio": "1corinthians-06.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 150400, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 2400, "text": "1 Corinthians, Chapter Six."}, {"start_ms": 2400, "end_ms": 9333, "text": "Dare any of you, having a matter against another, go to law before the unjust, and not before the saints?"}, {"start_ms": 9333, "end_ms": 12400, "text": "Do ye not know that the saints shall judge the world?"}, {"start_ms": 12400, "end_ms": 17333, "text": "and if the world shall be judged by you, are ye unworthy to judge the smallest matters?"}, {"start_ms": 17333, "end_ms": 20000, "text": "Know ye not that we shall judge angels?"}, {"start_ms": 20000, "end_ms": 22533, "text": "how much more things that pertain to this life?"}, {"start_ms": 22533, "end_ms": 29867, "text": "If then ye have judgments of things pertaining to this life, set them to judge who are least esteemed in the church."}, {"start_ms": 29867, "end_ms": 31467, "text": "I speak to your shame."}, {"start_ms": 31467, "end_ms": 34267, "text": "Is it so, that there is not a wise man among you?"}, {"start_ms": 34267, "end_ms": 37600, "text": "no, not one that shall be able to judge between his brethren?"}, {"start_ms": 37600, "end_ms": 42133, "text": "But brother goeth to law with brother, and that before the unbelievers."}, {"start_ms": 42133, "end_ms": 47733, "text": "Now therefore there is utterly a fault among you, because ye go to law one with another."}, {"start_ms": 47733, "end_ms": 50533, "text": "Why do ye not rather take wrong?"}, {"start_ms": 50533, "end_ms": 54133, "text": "why do ye not rather suffer yourselves to be defrauded?"}, {"start_ms": 54133, "end_ms": 57467, "text": "Nay, ye do wrong, and defraud, and that your brethren."}, {"start_ms": 57467, "end_ms": 61067, "text": "Know ye not that the unrighteous shall not inherit the kingdom of God?"}, {"start_ms": 61067, "end_ms": 75600, "text": "Be not deceived: neither fornicators, nor idolaters, nor adulterers, nor effeminate, nor abusers of themselves with mankind, Nor thieves, nor covetous, nor drunkards, nor revilers, nor extortioners, shall inherit the kingdom of God."}, {"start_ms": 75600, "end_ms": 85200, "text": "And such were some of you: but ye are washed, but ye are sanctified, but ye are justified in the name of the Lord Jesus, and by the Spirit of our God."}, {"start_ms": 85200, "end_ms": 94800, "text": "All things are lawful unto me, but all things are not expedient: all things are lawful for me, but I will not be brought under the power of any."}, {"start_ms": 94800, "end_ms": 100133, "text": "Meats for the belly, and the belly for meats: but God shall destroy both it and them."}, {"start_ms": 100133, "end_ms": 105067, "text": "Now the body is not for fornication, but for the Lord; and the Lord for the body."}, {"start_ms": 105067, "end_ms": 110267, "text": "And God hath both raised up the Lord, and will also raise up us by his own power."}, {"start_ms": 110267, "end_ms": 113733, "text": "Know ye not that your bodies are the members of Christ?"}, {"start_ms": 113733, "end_ms": 117600, "text": "shall I then take the members of Christ, and make them the members of an harlot?"}, {"start_ms": 117600, "end_ms": 118400, "text": "God forbid."}, {"start_ms": 118400, "end_ms": 119067, "text": "What?"}, {"start_ms": 119067, "end_ms": 122533, "text": "know ye not that he which is joined to an harlot is one body?"}, {"start_ms": 122533, "end_ms": 125600, "text": "for two, saith he, shall be one flesh."}, {"start_ms": 125600, "end_ms": 128800, "text": "But he that is joined unto the Lord is one spirit."}, {"start_ms": 128800, "end_ms": 130267, "text": "Flee fornication."}, {"start_ms": 130267, "end_ms": 136667, "text": "Every sin that a man doeth is without the body; but he that committeth fornication sinneth against his own body."}, {"start_ms": 136667, "end_ms": 137200, "text": "What?"}, {"start_ms": 137200, "end_ms": 143867, "text": "know ye not that your body is the temple of the Holy Ghost which is in you, which ye have of God, and ye are not your own?"}, {"start_ms": 143867, "end_ms": 150400, "text": "For ye are bought with a price: therefore glorify God in your body, and in your spirit, which are God's."}], "words": [{"t": "1", "s": 0, "e": 645, "si": 0}, {"t": "Corinthians,", "s": 645, "e": 1250, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 1513, "e": 1855, "si": 0}, {"t": "Six.", "s": 1936, "e": 2178, "si": 0}, {"t": "Dare", "s": 3302, "e": 3502, "si": 1}, {"t": "any", "s": 3522, "e": 3642, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 3702, "e": 3783, "si": 1}, {"t": "you,", "s": 3823, "e": 3943, "si": 1}, {"t": "having", "s": 4143, "e": 4404, "si": 1}, {"t": "a", "s": 4424, "e": 4444, "si": 1}, {"t": "matter", "s": 4524, "e": 4805, "si": 1}, {"t": "against", "s": 4845, "e": 5165, "si": 1}, {"t": "another,", "s": 5225, "e": 5546, "si": 1}, {"t": "go", "s": 6087, "e": 6167, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 6227, "e": 6287, "si": 1}, {"t": "law", "s": 6367, "e": 6528, "si": 1}, {"t": "before", "s": 6588, "e": 6888, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 6908, "e": 6989, "si": 1}, {"t": "unjust,", "s": 7049, "e": 7610, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 8131, "e": 8231, "si": 1}, {"t": "not", "s": 8271, "e": 8411, "si": 1}, {"t": "before", "s": 8471, "e": 8752, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 8772, "e": 8852, "si": 1}, {"t": "saints?", "s": 8932, "e": 9273, "si": 1}, {"t": "Do", "s": 9874, "e": 9954, "si": 2}, {"t": "ye", "s": 10015, "e": 10075, "si": 2}, {"t": "not", "s": 10155, "e": 10295, "si": 2}, {"t": "know", "s": 10355, "e": 10616, "si": 2}, {"t": "that", "s": 10716, "e": 10836, "si": 2}, {"t": "the", "s": 10877, "e": 10957, "si": 2}, {"t": "saints", "s": 11057, "e": 11318, "si": 2}, {"t": "shall", "s": 11358, "e": 11538, "si": 2}, {"t": "judge", "s": 11578, "e": 11839, "si": 2}, {"t": "the", "s": 11879, "e": 11979, "si": 2}, {"t": "world?", "s": 11999, "e": 12300, "si": 2}, {"t": "and", "s": 12982, "e": 13062, "si": 3}, {"t": "if", "s": 13062, "e": 13142, "si": 3}, {"t": "the", "s": 13162, "e": 13242, "s